 "intro_zh": "茅山景区位于江苏省西南部句容市，主峰大茅峰，似绿色苍龙之首，也是茅山的最高峰。茅山既是道教圣地，又是抗日根据地。山上景点多，有九峰、十九泉、二十六洞、二十八池之胜景。",
 "intro_en": "Maoshan Scenic Area is located in Jurong City, southwest of Jiangsu Province. The main peak, Damao Peak, looks like the head of a green dragon and is also the highest peak of Maoshan Mountain. Maoshan is both a Taoist holy land and an anti-Japanese base area. There are many scenic spots on the mountain, including nine peaks, nineteen springs, twenty-six caves and twenty-eight pools.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
